; ⚠️ GENERATED BY tools/gen_regions.py FROM tools/region_spec_pale_concord.py. Edit the spec.
;
; THE HIDDEN REALM. A country the Hollow Queen hid from death and from history, held at dusk: still
; fields, straight canals, immaculate roads nobody walks, and one preserved city whose residents do
; not die. The landing is in the south, the city three hundred metres north of it, and her palace on
; its terrace three hundred metres further on at the end of the processional way.

